les","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The mandatory node-restart protocol is also complete and coherent: it captures a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement and disconnection, a changed boot identity independently confirmed by lifecycle snapshots, and recovery of the system, timer, configuration, current log, and archive.","limitations":["No naturally timer-triggered daily rotation or full sequence of seven rotations was observed; cadence and retention depth are established by the parsed policy, while a forced rotation directly verifies compression and rotation behavior.","A temporary logrotate test-state file remained in /tmp after execution."]}
